<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND BEAT NZ BY SIX WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND BEAT NZ BY SIX WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>England, needing 132 from 26 overs to win a rain-shortened contest, beat New Zealand by six wickets in the second one-day international on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand 253 for eight from 50 overs (C. Cairns 79, B. Young 46)</p>
<p>England 134 for four from 19.3 overs (N. Knight 84 not out)</p>
